  "description": "Hye-Seo and Seon-Il have been childhood friends for a long time. Through a past-life experience, they discover that in a previous life, Hye-Seo was a lady of the house and Seon-Il was her servant. Despite their forbidden status in that past life, the two shared a passionate relationship. The intense chemistry between the lady and her servant evokes subtle emotions in the two even after they awaken from the past-life experience. Eventually, they begin a relationship in the present as well, bringing about a major change in their childhood friendship….\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
